No license has been chosen yet.

This is a template repository. Whoever stamps a real project out of it picks
a license — MIT, Apache-2.0, GPL-3.0-or-later, or whatever fits the
project's own goals — and replaces this file with its full text before the
project ships. Until then, nothing here is licensed for reuse.

Also update `license` in `package.nix`'s `meta` attrset to match, and the
SPDX identifier in `README.md`.
